@vendor=Advantech
@model=ADAM-4118
@description=8-channel isolated thermocouple input (J/K/T/E/R/S/B). FC03 addr 0-7: s16 ×0.1°C current temperature. Burn-out via FC02 addr 200-207. Modbus enabled when FF parameter bit2=1.
